{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01018","headline":"横吹曲辞 骢马曲 · 纪唐天","name":"横吹曲辞 骢马曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连钱出塞蹋沙蓬，岂比当时御史骢。\n逐北自谙深碛路，连嘶谁念静边功。\n登山每与青云合，弄影应知碧草同。\n今日虏平将换妾，不如罗袖舞春风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"纪唐天","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}